cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "Annotation Tool: assisted image and video annotation with SAM 3"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez Ferrer"
    given-names: "Alejandro"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/asferrer/annotation-tool"
abstract: >-
  Web application for assisted annotation of image and video datasets.
  It combines SAM 3 text-prompted segmentation, interactive point-based
  segmentation, video tracking and one-shot propagation (INSID3 with DINOv3),
  with multi-format import and export through Datumaro.
keywords:
  - annotation
  - segmentation
  - SAM 3
  - dataset labeling
  - computer vision
